# Lite local container profiles (D78 / story #120). Extended D94 / M09.
# Format: profile=service1 service2 ...
# Services are CICD/Local/<service>/ directories with docker-compose.y*ml.
# API and Admin UI are host npm processes — not listed here.
# Airflow compose still includes Airflow's own metadata Postgres; that is not the CCA operational store.
# pgvector profile aliases to postgres (ops DB hosts vector extension — D94).
sqlite=airflow
postgres=airflow postgres
mongodb=airflow mongodb
pgvector=airflow postgres
chroma=airflow chroma
redis=airflow redis
# Iceberg Spark stack is opt-in (not part of sqlite/postgres defaults). Stop keeps volumes.
iceberg=iceberg
